Only the 20 glyphs mapped below are included, not the complete icon library.
The corresponding official icons/<name>.svg files were downloaded directly from
that commit. Their path geometry, 24x24 viewBox, round caps/joins and 2-unit stroke
were preserved. currentColor was resolved to white and each SVG rasterized by
rsvg-convert 2.63.4 to a transparent 96x96 PNG for tinting at native UI sizes.
No SVG parser, icon package, network download or rasterization runs in the game.
Generated files are in Common/Textures/IrisMenus/UI/Glyphs/<name>.png.
Grid uses Lucide Grip, matching the prototype's dotted grip symbol. Settings
retains SlidersHorizontal for the reusable public glyph API even when individual
mods supply their own sidebar icons. ArrowRight remains a right-pointing source
icon so existing render-only rotation arguments preserve their meaning.

